{"version":1,"key":"card:752","content":{"id":752,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"97213ee2-d3e7-408a-8705-dd2642363e7c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在计算两点距离或向量模长时，手动用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Math.sqrt"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 写平方和容易遇到数值溢出的问题，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Math.hypot"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 就是为此而生的，它计算所有参数平方和的平方根。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2650bc93-9861-4cff-a78d-e84301f89eda","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"82e8d321-dec5-465a-ae23-e6773675eb60","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Math.hypot(value1, value2, /* …, */ valueN)","collabId":"e2b60718-7789-43f8-a082-763d60577dd7","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"block-math","tauContract":"4e356b907f162ad0eb2111e676848e89bc290d4d1bc01f9238aef92a7b5f8861","tex":"\\text{Math.hypot}(v_1, v_2, \\cdots, v_n) = \\sqrt{\\sum_{i}^{n}v_i^2}","collabId":"04747603-0919-4f58-86a1-0d25f33c3a6e","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a16c1eb-ec37-41f6-8ec6-33fcd26064d5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"最常见的用途是计算二维、三维空间的距离，或者向量的模。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"f1ea9fac-4f65-4ea7-8ced-fa4bc7d151af","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"13b4914a-0d83-4bae-bda2-848f4cc00004","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"// 二维两个点的距离\nfunction distance(x1, y1, x2, y2) {\n  return Math.hypot(x2 - x1, y2 - y1);\n}\n\ndistance(0, 0, 3, 4); // 5","collabId":"7e7d5b20-5b66-4207-91df-ceb65f3d4720","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"9b3c6035-1f73-4b4c-97b2-f3d5f6a55df8","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"相比直接使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Math.sqrt"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 手动计算，它的优势在于："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","collabId":"e2e3e91f-186f-4ee0-bfa9-8570c5e83f33","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"28daa04c-fc31-46d4-b2ea-2a955230017d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"5d94e82f-fe2d-44b3-9662-688714900baf","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"防溢出，内部处理了极大值和极小值"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"6b5fea52-3d35-4bbe-9c24-93d94e81ce18","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"25d3e695-5b28-447e-a16e-b84539a998a8","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const big = 1e200;\n\n// 手动计算 — 中间值溢出为 Infinity\nMath.sqrt(big * big + big * big); // Infinity ❌\n\n// Math.hypot — 正确处理\nMath.hypot(big, big); // 1.4142135623730951e+200 ✅","collabId":"5dfd7585-a371-4b77-bf4d-1cf5a602b10a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"0d8f30b0-004e-4e77-96e6-e98073828e5d","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"20f7801b-2416-43d8-9afe-9ad15f09d310","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"高精度，更好的数值稳定性"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"2defb2b6-c68d-4ecd-a0bd-2dcc8550a536","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"57560e13-18c7-4b37-bad8-6fb7a8de9efe","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const x = 1e-300;\nconst y = 1e-300;\n\nMath.hypot(x, y);          // 1.4142135623730952e-300（正确）✅\nMath.sqrt(x*x + y*y);      // 0 ❌（x*x 下溢为 0）","collabId":"fe33da9b-b4db-4c1f-b402-fc37054c4359","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0437b59c-4e3e-43f0-b70d-9b1a8c695730","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"另外它对特殊值也有明确的处理规则："}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"0ee780f6-3c64-4682-9b5e-23ff63c763b2","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9e4d15d1-1d72-42a1-911f-7780a3db4807","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"Math.hypot(Infinity, NaN);  // Infinity（只要有一个 Infinity 就返回 Infinity）\nMath.hypot(NaN, 3);         // NaN（含 NaN 且无 Infinity 时返回 NaN）\nMath.hypot();               // 0\nMath.hypot(0);              // 0","collabId":"12f4e901-190c-4a75-bd58-e7589dbf6f51","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Math"],"createTime":1780617927317,"updateTime":1780618843929,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1780618843929}}